# Agent working material, not part of the product. The skills under `.agents/` are third-party
# copies (MIT and Apache-2.0) pulled by `skills-lock.json`, and redistributing them would mean
# carrying their notices; they are tooling rather than product, so they stay local instead.
# `UNTITLED.md` is Untitled UI's own AGENTS.md, kept locally for the same reason.
/.agents/
/.claude/
/skills-lock.json
/UNTITLED.md

# Working notes and review reports that are not part of the product. They list this deployment's
# open weaknesses, so sweeping them into a public repository would publish that list alongside it.
# Ignored rather than deleted: they are worth keeping locally.
/p
docs/code-review-*.md

